    "body": "> We are developing an in-browser racing game that relies heavily on gamepads and particularly complex racing wheels and pedals.\n> \n@razvanphp \nHello, razvanphp\nCan I know what games you are developing with webhid? I am also working on webhid, and I am really looking forward to try your game if it is ready.\n\nThank you\n\n",
